error[keywords]: `int8` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:3:10
   │
 2 │ struct IntTypes {
 3 │     long int8;              // 'int8' is a keyword
   ·          ^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
 4 │     long int16;             // 'int16' is a keyword
 5 │     long int32;             // 'int32' is a keyword
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_int8`
 note: keywords are matched case-insensitively against identifiers

